  - Operator-pause dialog (App.tsx wiring of the **shipped** `OperatorPauseDialog`) → validation {n/a} · instrumentation {n/a — UI} · PII {n/a} · tests {build/type✓ (tsc+vite); axe/keyboard defer ch9} · a11y {WCAG✓ — reuses the shipped Radix `alertdialog` (role + focus-trap + Escape + focus-restore); titlebar `'hold'` run-state already shipped; full axe/keyboard defers to the Epoch-9 a11y-harness ch9 per the carried route note} · tokens {design-token✓ — reuses the tokened scaffold CSS; App.tsx/Gallery.tsx use `var(--…)` only, no hardcoded hex/px; Proceed/Abort pair color+text, never color-alone}

